an><span class=\"ha-itm\"><span class=\"ha-txt ha-txto ht-3\">N</span><span class=\"ha-txtb ha-txto ht-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--char: 'N'\"></span></span><span class=\"ha-itm\"><span class=\"ha-txt ha-txto ht-4\">T</span><span class=\"ha-txtb ha-txto ht-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--char: 'T'\"></span></span><span class=\"ha-itm\"><span class=\"ha-txt ha-txto ht-5\">A</span><span class=\"ha-txtb ha-txto ht-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--char: 'A'\"></span></span><span class=\"ha-itm\"><span class=\"ha-txt ha-txto ht-6\">C</span><span class=\"ha-txtb ha-txto ht-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--char: 'C'\"></span></span><span class=\"ha-itm\"><span class=\"ha-txt ha-txto ht-7\">T</span><span class=\"ha-txtb ha-txto ht-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--char: 'T'\"></span></span></span></a></div></header><main class=\"legal-doc\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><div class=\"legal-doc__inner\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h1 class=\"legal-doc__title\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"legal-doc__updated\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Last updated: August 14, 2026</p><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>1. Who we are</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Kiasa Inc. (&quot;Kiasa&quot;, &quot;we&quot;, &quot;us&quot;).</p><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Address: 1-13-18 Nishishinsaibashi, Chuo-ku, Osaka 542-0086, Japan</p><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Representative Director: Jocelyn André Claude Lecamus</p></section><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>2. How we use your personal information</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>When you contact us through a form on this site, we collect the information you provide (such as your name, company, email address, and message) along with basic context about how you reached us — the referring site or campaign parameters, the first page you visited, the pages you viewed during that visit, and whether you have visited before. We use this information only for the following purposes:</p><ul class=\"legal-doc__list\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><li data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>To respond to your inquiry and communicate with you</li><li data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>To prepare estimates, proposals, and meetings</li><li data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>To enter into and perform a contract with you</li><li data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>To share information about our services</li></ul></section><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>3. Sharing with third parties</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>We do not share your personal information with third parties without your consent, except where required by law.</p></section><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>4. Processors</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>We may entrust the handling of personal information to external service providers to the extent necessary to fulfil the purposes above, and we supervise them appropriately. This site uses an external service (Google / Gmail) to send email.</p></section><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>5. Lead attribution and analytics</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>We store lead-attribution information in your browser for up to 30 days and send it to us only if you submit a contact form. You can erase it by clearing this site’s stored data in your browser settings.</p><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>We use analytics tools such as Google Analytics to improve our services. These use cookies to collect traffic data that does not personally identify you. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p></section><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>6. Access, correction, and deletion</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>To request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, please contact us at the address below. We will respond promptly and reasonably in accordance with applicable law.</p></section><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>7. Contact</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>For questions about this policy or the handling of personal information, please contact:</p><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Kiasa Inc.</p><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Email: contact@utsubo.co</p></section><section class=\"legal-doc__section\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3><h2 class=\"legal-doc__heading\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>8. Changes to this policy</h2><p class=\"legal-doc__p\" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>We may update this policy in response to changes in law or our practices. Updates take effect once posted on this page.</p></section></div></main><footer class=\"sec-layout \"><div class=\"flx footer-col-links\"><div class=\"footer-bottom flx\"><h2 class=\"footer-cat-title\">Follow us</h2><ul class=\"footer-links flx-column\"><li><a href=\"https://x.com/utsuboco\" class=\"sns-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> X / Twitter </a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/utsuboco/\" class=\"sns-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Instagram </a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/utsuboco/\" class=\"sns-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> LinkedIn </a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/utsuboco\" class=\"sns-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> GitHub </a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@utsuboco\" class=\"sns-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noope